== Overview ==
{{Toilet Infobox|title1=Buff Mutant Toilet|image1=Screenshot 2024-08-14 161841.png|description=Description|species=[[Mutant Toilet]]|health=6.8m (around wave 50)|speed=Average|wave_debut=Around wave 50|modes=[[Endless Mode]]|abilities=He does a lot of workout.}}
The '''Buff Mutant Toilet''' is an enemy that has been added in the [[Episode 75 Update]].

== Appearance ==
He has a pair of shades, a laser mounted on the right side of his shoulder, two blades on each seperate arm, a beanie with headphones, and a jetpack on his back.

== Trivia ==
This enemy is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Berserker_Skibidi_Mutant#Upgraded_Berserker_Mutant_Skibidi_Toilet Upgraded Berseker Skibidi Mutant] from the series

